  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** PMI’s smoke‑free portfolio (IQOS, ZYN) continues to gain momentum, now a major revenue contributor as the company shifts away from combustibles. Consumer adoption of reduced‑risk alternatives remains robust, and inclusion in Forbes’ Net Zero Leaders list underscores its sustainability positioning. (The search input contained unrelated ISM PMI readings and a payments‑company report, which are not pertinent to PMI’s own narrative.)\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Management is refinancing high‑cost obligations with attractively priced long‑term notes, following a large debt redemption, preserving financial flexibility for the smoke‑free transition. Strong cash generation supports a conservative balance sheet and shareholder returns. The market’s premium valuation reflects confidence in this predictable, disciplined capital allocation and the strategic pivot toward reduced‑risk products.",
